---
import LegalPageLayout from '../../layouts/LegalPageLayout.astro';
import { dataRequestPath } from '../../i18n/paths';
---

<LegalPageLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="FaktumAI website privacy policy."
  path="/en/privacy/"
>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 14 September 2026</p>

  <h2>1. Controller</h2>
  <p>
    Marko Virta / FaktumAI<br />
    <a href="mailto:marko@faktum-ai.com">marko@faktum-ai.com</a><br />
    <a href="https://www.faktum-ai.com">https://www.faktum-ai.com</a>
  </p>

  <h2>2. Personal data we process</h2>
  <p>
    FaktumAI processes personal data only when a user contacts FaktumAI by email
    or uses the personal-data request function.
  </p>
  <p>Data may include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>name and email address if provided in an enquiry</li>
    <li>contents of the enquiry</li>
    <li>email address and verification token for a data request</li>
    <li>a hash derived from the IP address and a truncated browser user-agent for secure processing of data requests</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The site's visitor counter stores only the total number of page views and
    does not store visitor personal data.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
  <p>Data is processed to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>respond to enquiries and handle steps related to a potential customer relationship</li>
    <li>fulfil data subject rights</li>
    <li>protect the website and data-request functions</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Depending on the situation, processing is based on steps prior to entering
    into a contract, legitimate interests, or a legal obligation under Article 6 GDPR.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Recipients and transfers</h2>
  <p>
    Personal data may be processed using technical hosting, database and email
    services used by FaktumAI where necessary to provide the service.
  </p>
  <p>
    Where personal data is processed outside the European Economic Area,
    transfers are carried out using safeguards required by applicable data
    protection law.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Personal data is retained only for as long as necessary for the purpose
    for which it was collected or as required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under applicable data protection law, you may have the right to access,
    rectify or erase your personal data and, depending on the circumstances,
    to restrict or object to processing and to data portability.
  </p>
  <p>Data requests: <a href={dataRequestPath('en')}>Your data page</a></p>
  <p>
    You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the competent data
    protection supervisory authority.
  </p>
  <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:marko@faktum-ai.com">marko@faktum-ai.com</a></p>
</LegalPageLayout>
